      "content": "The void you feel is real, and the pain of losing your purpose is so heavy that the only logical choice seems to be to stop existing. It is a terrible, quiet tragedy to feel like a mistake, but the darkness you are sitting in is not your final destination; it is just the silence before the next chapter begins. Please, do not let the idea of the void swallowing you become your only option, because there is still a future waiting for you, even if you cannot see it right now.",
